      "message": "doc: say the sha256 compression callback processes secrets\n\nThe function set by secp256k1_context_set_sha256_compression hashes\nsecret keys, for example when deriving RFC 6979 nonces. Say so, and\nrequire it to run in constant time and not to keep or log its input.\n\nFixes #1958.\n\nAssisted-by: my usual tools (LLM, Internet, computer). Mistakes are mine.\nSigned-off-by: Ferdinando Ametrano <ferdinando@ametrano.net>",
